  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- The new `Trail` property was added to the `ChangeOrderRequest` class for updating trailing-stop orders (same unit as the original order).\n- Added a `net10.0` target; existing target frameworks are unchanged.\n- The new `IAlpacaOptionsStreamingClient` interface provides real-time options market data streaming.\n- The `IAlpacaOptionsDataClient` interface now supports historical option quotes and latest option bars.\n- The new `IOrderImbalance` interface and `GetOrderImbalanceSubscription` method were added to `IAlpacaDataStreamingClient`.\n- BREAKING: The `IsDayPatternTrader` and `DayTradeCount` properties were removed from the `IAccount` interface because the corresponding `pattern_day_trader` and `daytrade_count` fields no longer exist in the Alpaca Trading API `Account` response.\n- BREAKING: The public `UseMessagePack` getter was removed from `StreamingClientConfiguration`.\n- Fixed a bug where the `NonMarginableBuyingPower` property of the `IAccount` interface was never populated due to a JSON property name typo (`non_maginable_buying_power` instead of `non_marginable_buying_power`).\n- Fixed options streaming endpoint construction so the `v1beta1` path is not duplicated.\n- The HTTP User-Agent header now follows the cross-SDK `APCA-DOTNET/<sdk-version> .NET/<runtime-version>` format.\n- The new `MarginRequirementLong` and `MarginRequirementShort` properties were added to the `IAsset` interface.\n- The old `MaintenanceMarginRequirement` property of the `IAsset` interface is marked as obsolete.\n- The new `Boats` and `Overnight` values were added to the `MarketDataFeed` enumeration.\n- The `BaseValue` property in `IPortfolioHistory` was changed to be nullable.\n- The new `CryptoPerpetual` value was added to the `AssetClass` enumeration (preparatory - not currently functional).\n- Clarified crypto perpetual futures documentation: Alpaca Markets currently supports spot crypto trading only.\n- The new `Ascx` value was added to the `Exchange` enumeration.\n- All dependencies were updated to the latest stable versions.",
